    "background_story": "Joel was a man of habit and routine. Every day, he would wake up at exactly 6:00 AM, brush his teeth, and head to the local coffee shop for a cup of black coffee. The baristas knew him so well that they would have his drink ready before he even ordered. Joel's regularity extended to his work as a librarian, where he would meticulously catalog books and maintain the shelves with precision. His colleagues admired his attention to detail and reliability. Even on weekends, Joel would stick to his routine, visiting the same park for a morning jog and reading the same newspaper. His love for regularity brought a sense of comfort and stability to his life, and those around him appreciated the predictability of his daily rhythms.",
